{"agent":"bg112","data":{"by":"grok-4.7","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"The rewrite still does not lock B5225d3ad22's \"twice in a row\" loss of place. Both `SL.hold(..., \"patient\")` calls run while the queue has no other waiter, and the loop's `any(... .parked and \"patient\" in p.name)` is not cleared between iterations. After the first timeout leaves `queue/*patient*.parked`, the second `hold` can raise `SuiteBusy` without parking (or can drop that ticket) and the same leftover file still satisfies the assert. `late` is started only after both give-ups, so a single leftover park reclaimed by the final `_waiter(\"patient\")` still yields `order == [\"patient\", \"late\"]`. A regression that parks once and loses the place on the second give-up — the reported starvation — passes this test.","digest":"9f18f35c793808ec","family":"xai","location":"tests/test_suitelock_queue.py:164","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"tests/test_suitelock_queue.py:164"}],"chunks_total":1,"combined_gates":["rubber_duck","critic"],"coverage":"1/1 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":1830,"diff_sha":"b5be604d6f5951abc6695b227c1e585e728210c5b32a2c68c6cf4f7744119d85","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/fix-B5225d3ad22","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":85.3,"family":"xai","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":8000,"model":"grok-4.7","output_digest":"705d48361b380cb0","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B5225d3ad22.rubber_duck.grok-4.7.20261109T031934Z-6f890ffe.jsonl","reason":"","review_degraded":[{"at":1794194374.961114,"family":"google","gate":"rubber_duck","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","reason":"HTTP 429","reviewer":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite"}],"review_id":"9357495ac1e4","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1],"reviewed_head":"9b9e7c69ff39d8b6e0f1af7e1c8a4b388604879a","reviewed_paths":{"tests/test_suitelock_queue.py":"100644 97fc8d670850288335ba